{{define "content"}}
<section class="client-detail-page">
<a class="back-link" href="/ui/clients/" aria-label="返回客户端列表"><span aria-hidden="true">‹</span>客户端</a>
<h1>{{.Client.Name}}</h1>
<p class="muted">{{.Client.SourceText}} · profile {{.Client.ProfileName}}</p>

<section class="shared-card client-profile-card">
<h2>profile</h2>
<p>{{.Client.ProfileName}} · 它能看到 {{.Client.ServerCount}} 台服务器</p>
<div class="client-server-list">
{{range .Client.Servers}}<div class="client-server-row"><strong>{{.Name}}</strong></div>{{end}}
</div>
<a class="secondary-link" href="/ui/clients/{{.Client.ID}}/profile">更换</a>
</section>

<section class="shared-card client-status-card">
<h2>状态</h2>
<dl class="client-status-list">
<div class="client-status-row"><dt>最后同步</dt><dd>{{.Client.LastPullText}}</dd></div>
<div class="client-status-row"><dt>客户端版本</dt><dd>{{if .Client.ClientVersion}}{{.Client.ClientVersion}}{{else}}未声明{{end}}</dd></div>
<div class="client-status-row"><dt>推荐版本</dt><dd>{{if .Client.RecommendedVersion}}{{.Client.RecommendedVersion}}{{else}}未知{{end}}</dd></div>
<div class="client-status-row"><dt>版本对比</dt><dd>{{.Client.VersionComparisonText}}</dd></div>
<div class="client-status-row"><dt>设备码前缀</dt><dd>{{.Client.TokenPrefix}}…</dd></div>
</dl>
</section>

<section class="shared-card client-machine-card">
<h2>所在机器</h2>
{{with .Client.Machine}}
<p><strong>机器 {{.Name}}</strong>{{if .SitePath}} · {{.SitePath}}{{end}}</p>
{{with $.Client.Software}}
<p>最近采集 {{.LastCollectedAt.Format "2006-01-02 15:04:05"}} · {{.ItemCount}} 个软件 · {{.PendingExposureCount}} 个待确认暴露</p>
<ul>{{range .TopItems}}<li>{{.}}</li>{{end}}</ul>
<a href="/ui/software-inventory/devices?device={{$.Client.Machine.Name | urlquery}}">查看全部</a>
<form method="post" action="/ui/software-inventory/collect?device={{$.Client.Machine.Name | urlquery}}">
<input type="hidden" name="csrf_token" value="{{$.CSRFToken}}">
<button type="submit">立即采集</button>
</form>
{{end}}
{{else}}
<p>还不知道这个客户端运行在哪台机器上。</p>
<a class="secondary-link" href="/ui/clients/{{$.Client.ID}}/machine">选择机器</a>
{{end}}
</section>

<section class="shared-card client-resource-card">
<h2>它能用到的机密项与共享存储</h2>
<ul class="client-resource-list">
{{range .Client.Secrets}}<li class="client-resource-row"><strong class="client-resource-name">{{.Name}}</strong><small class="client-resource-note">{{if .Note}}{{firstLine .Note}}{{else}}没有备注{{end}}</small><small class="client-resource-via">机密项 · 经过：{{joinTags .ViaServers}}</small></li>{{end}}
{{range .Client.Shares}}<li class="client-resource-row"><strong class="client-resource-name">{{.Name}}</strong><small class="client-resource-note">{{if .Note}}{{firstLine .Note}}{{else}}没有备注{{end}}</small><small class="client-resource-via">共享存储 · 经过：{{joinTags .ViaServers}}</small></li>{{end}}
</ul>
{{if not (or .Client.Secrets .Client.Shares)}}<p>当前 profile 没有可用的机密项或共享存储。</p>{{end}}
<p class="muted">由 profile 中的服务器与各机密项、共享存储的授权共同决定。</p>
</section>

<section class="shared-card client-danger-card">
<h2>危险区</h2>
<p>移除后客户端无法再同步，本地已有的副本会在下次同步时失效。</p>
<a class="danger-link" href="/ui/clients/{{.Client.ID}}/remove">移除客户端</a>
</section>
</section>
{{end}}
